- Session Management Refactored: InteractionSession replaces DualEntitySession — sessions are interaction-scoped (not entity-pair-scoped), events keyed by interactionId.
- Chat Screens Adapted: ChatListScreen and ChatDetailScreen adapted to InteractionSession model; JOIN-based queries for chat list previews (conversation_messages JOIN interactions).
