- Dynamic Atmospheric Background: Aurora/Nebula animated background with stardust particles integrated as a persistent layer behind the navigation stack. Uses Haute Goth palette (Deep Goth Blue-Black, Neon Magenta, Indigo) with 5 animated gradient blobs, prime-number cycle durations, and 40 drifting light particles with twinkling opacity.
